    "long_instructions": "# Exploring Conditionals\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Explore the gaming dashboard and find values that can change, like health or username.\r\n2. Place a circle by each variable and match it to one of the colored prompts on the right. Fill in the prompts by describing:\r\n    - What the value is right now\r\n    - What user action could change it\r\n    - What it might change to"
